🛠 Examples of Famous MVPs
Dropbox → Started with a simple video showing the concept before building full infrastructure.

Airbnb → Began by renting out their own apartment with a basic website.

Zappos → Tested online shoe sales by posting pictures and buying shoes locally after orders.
